ate reputation through EPIC voyages where you'll test yourself by collecting as much treasure as possible and bringing it back safely to your Pirate hideout.\n\nBUT BE WARNED . . .\n\nYou're not the only Pirate seeking fortune on the seas.\n\nFight off Pirate enemies on land with your Pirate weapon of choice\n\n- OR -\n\nBattle them on the seas using your ship's cannons and VOICE COMMANDS!\n\nPut your plunder to good use and use your riches to equip yourself with the best weapons and ships a Pirate could ask for.\n\nWith an Open World filled with Treasure, Mysterious Islands and limitless possibilities there's only one question to ask . . .\n\nArrrrgh you ready to set SAIL ???\n\nPLEASE NOTE: This is game is Early Access so it is not perfect and still a work in progress. We appreciate any and all feedback so leave it in a review or JOIN THE DISCORD and let us know there!\n\nTHANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING SAIL!!!", "short_description": "Unleash your Inner Pirate!!!! - Open World VR Pirate Game"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://garett-cook.com/index.php/sail-early-access-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red Team Nineteen", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.garett-cook.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "FIGHTING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_int